<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.9.7">
<l>kuṟaṭpirama cāriyāy  māvaliyaik</l>
<l rend="indent">kuṟumpatakki yaracu vāṅki</l>
<l>yiṟaippoḻitil pātāḷaṅ kalavirukkai</l>
<l rend="indent">koṭuttukanta vemmāṉ kōyil</l>
<l>eṟippuṭaiya maṇivaraimē liḷañāyi</l>
<l rend="indent">ṟeḻuntāṟpō larava ṇaiyiṉvāy</l>
<l>ciṟappuṭaiya paṇaṅkaḷmicaic ceḻumaṇikaḷ</l>
<l rend="indent">viṭṭeṟikkun tiruva raṅkamē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The temple of our Lord who was pleased,</l>
<l rend="indent">having, as a dwarf brahmācārya,</l>
<l rend="indent">overcame the power of Māvali,</l>
<l rend="indent">took [his] kingdom, [and] in an instant</l>
<l rend="indent">gave [him] hell as a home,</l>
<l>is holy Araṅkam where beautiful jewels shine</l>
<l rend="indent">on the lustrous hoods of [his] serpent bed</l>
<l rend="indent">as if the morning sun rose on radiant jewelled mountain.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
